# Example values for Brand Scout (copy to your notes or pass on the CLI / CTI dialog).
#
# Phishing scan (-ps / ALL): use fully qualified domain names so dnstwist and domain-sift
# can generate valid permutations (typosquats). Bare brand names like "Lalamove" are invalid.
#
# Good:  lalamove.com, shop.example.co.uk
# Bad:   Lalamove, AcmeCorp
#
# Example for ALL mode (matches brand_scout.py -all DOMAIN KEYWORD START END):
#   DOMAIN=lalamove.com
#   KEYWORD=Lalamove
#
# Keywords for SMS can stay as brand text; domains for PS must be FQDNs.
